border-b border-white/[0.03] py-6 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-300 transition-colors hover:text-ssl-gold\" style=\"transition-delay:0ms\"><span>Services</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"h-6 w-6 opacity-30\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"/about\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/[0.03] py-6 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-300 transition-colors hover:text-ssl-gold\" style=\"transition-delay:50ms\"><span>About</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"h-6 w-6 opacity-30\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"/contact\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/[0.03] py-6 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-300 transition-colors hover:text-ssl-gold\" style=\"transition-delay:100ms\"><span>Contact</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"h-6 w-6 opacity-30\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></a></div><a href=\"/contact\" class=\"mt-10 flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-[#8a6f3e] to-[#c5a059] py-5 text-base font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#01081b] shadow-xl shadow-ssl-gold/20 transition-transform active:scale-95\">Get in Touch</a></nav></div></header><main class=\"flex-grow\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"@id\":\"https://signalstraitlabs.com/services/revenue-operations-revops#faq\",\"url\":\"https://signalstraitlabs.com/services/revenue-operations-revops\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"We already use a CRM. Why do we need RevOps?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Having a CRM isn't the same as having it set up right. Many teams use only a fraction of what their CRM can do, and leads still fall through the cracks.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Which CRMs do you work with?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"HubSpot, Zoho, and Salesforce. If you're on something else, talk to us and we'll let you know if we can support it.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can you work with our existing sales team, or do we need to change how they work?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"We build around your team's actual process. Some habits may need to change, but the goal is to make their job easier, not harder.\"}}]}</script><section class=\"relative isolate overflow-hidden bg-ssl-bg\"><picture><source media=\"(min-width: 768px)\" srcSet=\"/images/service-revops-1920.webp\" type=\"image/webp\"/><img src=\"/images/service-revops-720.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"absolute inset-0 -z-30 h-full w-full object-cover\" loading=\"eager\" fetchPriority=\"high\" decoding=\"sync\"/></picture><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 -z-20 bg-gradient-to-b from-ssl-bg/90 via-ssl-bg/70 to-ssl-bg/95\"></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-[radial-gradient(50rem_26rem_at_50%_-10%,rgba(26,89,204,0.35),transparent_70%)]\"></div><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 pb-28 pt-16 text-center sm:px-6 md:pb-32 md:pt-20\"><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" class=\"mb-8 flex justify-center\"><ol class=\"glass-chip inline-flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1 rounded-full px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-slate-300\"><li><a class=\"transition-colors hover:text-white\" href=\"/\">Home</a></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-slate-500\">/</span><a class=\"transition-colors hover:text-white\" href=\"/services\">Services</a></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-slate-500\">/</span><span aria-current=\"page\" class=\"text-ssl-gold\">Revenue Operations (RevOps)</span></li></ol></nav><div class=\"glass-chip mx-auto mb-6 flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl text-ssl-gold\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flex\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-dollar-sign h-8 w-8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"2\" y2=\"22\"></line><path d=\"M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6\"></path></svg></span></div><h1 class=\"text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl\">Revenue Operations (RevOps)</h1><p class=\"mx-auto mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-300\">CRM setup in HubSpot, Zoho or Salesforce, multi-touch attribution dashboards and lead scoring that remove friction from your sales funnel.</p></div></section><div class=\"mesh-light relative isolate px-4 pb-24 sm:px-6\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-10 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute -left-32 top-[8%] h-[28rem] w-[28rem] rounded-full bg-[radial-gradient(circle,rgba(26,89,204,0.32),transparent_65%)]\"></div><div class=\"absolute -right-24 top-[38%] h-[30rem] w-[30rem] rounded-full bg-[radial-gradient(circle,rgba(197,160,89,0.38),transparent_65%)]\"></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-[-6rem] left-[30%] h-[24rem] w-[24rem] rounded-full bg-[radial-gradient(circle,rgba(56,189,248,0.22),transparent_65%)]\"></div></div><div class=\"relative z-10 mx-auto -mt-16 grid max-w-6xl grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-3\"><section class=\"reveal reveal-slide-up glass-card-light glass-edge rounded-2xl p-7 md:p-8\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mb-5 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-ssl-blue to-[#0d3a8c] font-display text-sm font-bold text-white shadow-lg shadow-ssl-blue/25\">0<!-- -->1</span><h2 class=\"mb-3 text-xl font-bold text-ssl-bg\">The Problem</h2><p class=\"leading-relaxed text-slate-700\">Sales and marketing often work from different numbers. Leads fall through the cracks between the CRM, the ad platform, and a sales spreadsheet.</p></section><section class=\"reveal reveal-slide-up glass-card-light glass-edge rounded-2xl p-7 md:p-8\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mb-5 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-ssl-blue to-[#0d3a8c] font-display text-sm font-bold text-white shadow-lg shadow-ssl-blue/25\">0<!-- -->2</span><h2 class=\"mb-3 text-xl font-bold text-ssl-bg\">Our Approach</h2><p class=\"leading-relaxed text-slate-700\">We build your CRM pipeline properly in HubSpot, Zoho, or Salesforce, connect it to how leads actually enter your funnel, and score them so the right leads reach your sales team first.</p></section><section class=\"reveal reveal-slide-up glass-card-light glass-edge rounded-2xl p-7 md:p-8\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mb-5 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-ssl-blue to-[#0d3a8c] font-display text-sm font-bold text-white shadow-lg shadow-ssl-blue/25\">0<!-- -->3</span><h2 class=\"mb-3 text-xl font-bold text-ssl-bg\">The Outcome</h2><p class=\"leading-relaxed text-slate-700\">One pipeline everyone trusts, less time chasing cold leads, and a clear line from marketing spend to closed revenue.</p></section></div><section class=\"mx-auto mt-24 max-w-3xl\"><div class=\"reveal reveal-slide-up\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 text-center items-center mb-10\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-ssl-gold-deep\">FAQ</p><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl text-ssl-bg\">Common Questions</h2></div></div><div class=\"space-y-4\"><div class=\"glass-card-light glass-edge overflow-hidden rounded-2xl\"><button type=\"button\" id=\"_R_2dlfiv5udb_-q0\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"_R_2dlfiv5udb_-a0\" class=\"flex w-full items-center justify-between p-6 text-left\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-ssl-bg\">We already use a CRM. Why do we need RevOps?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-5 w-5 text-ssl-blue transition-transform duration-300\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><div id=\"_R_2dlfiv5udb_-a0\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"_R_2dlfiv5udb_-q0\" inert=\"\" class=\"grid transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden\"><p class=\"px-6 pb-6 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">Having a CRM isn&#x27;t the same as having it set up right. Many teams use only a fraction of what their CRM can do, and leads still fall through the cracks.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"glass-card-light glass-edge overflow-hidden rounded-2xl\"><button type=\"button\" id=\"_R_2dlfiv5udb_-q1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"_R_2dlfiv5udb_-a1\" class=\"flex w-full items-center justify-between p-6 text-left\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-ssl-bg\">Which CRMs do you work with?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-5 w-5 text-ssl-blue transition-transform duration-300\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><div id=\"_R_2dlfiv5udb_-a1\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"_R_2dlfiv5udb_-q1\" inert=\"\" class=\"grid transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden\"><p class=\"px-6 pb-6 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">HubSpot, Zoho, and Salesforce. If you&#x27;re on something else, talk to us and we&#x27;ll let you know if we can support it.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"glass-card-light glass-edge overflow-hidden rounded-2xl\"><button type=\"button\" id=\"_R_2dlfiv5udb_-q2\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"_R_2dlfiv5udb_-a2\" class=\"flex w-full items-center justify-between p-6 text-left\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-ssl-bg\">Can you work with our existing sales team, or do we need to change how they work?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-5 w-5 text-ssl-blue transition-transform duration-300\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><div id=\"_R_2dlfiv5udb_-a2\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"_R_2dlfiv5udb_-q2\" inert=\"\" class=\"grid transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden\"><p class=\"px-6 pb-6 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">We build around your team&#x27;s actual process. Some habits may need to change, but the goal is to make their job easier, not harder.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"mx-auto mt-24 max-w-6xl\"><div class=\"reveal reveal-slide-up\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 text-center items-center mb-10\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-ssl-gold-deep\">KEEP EXPLORING</p><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl text-ssl-bg\">Related Services</h2></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl overflow-hidden glass-card-light glass-edge glass-hover reveal reveal-slide-up group h-full\"><a class=\"flex h-full flex-col p-7 md:p-8\" href=\"/services/technical-infrastructure-web-dev\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-x-8 top-0 h-[2px] origin-left scale-x-0 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-ssl-gold via-ssl-gold to-ssl-blue transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-x-100\"></span><div class=\"flex flex-col w-full items-start mb-7 h-auto justify-start gap-4\"><div class=\"p-2.5 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center border transition-colors duration-300 border-white/40 bg-gradient-to-br from-ssl-blue to-[#0d3a8c] text-white shadow-lg shadow-ssl-blue/25 group-hover:from-ssl-gold group-hover:to-[#9A7432] group-hover:shadow-ssl-gold/30\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flex\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-cpu h-6 w-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 20v2\"></path><path d=\"M12 2v2\"></path><path d=\"M17 20v2\"></path><path d=\"M17 2v2\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h2\"></path><path d=\"M2 17h2\"></path><path d=\"M2 7h2\"></path><path d=\"M20 12h2\"></path><path d=\"M20 17h2\"></path><path d=\"M20 7h2\"></path><path d=\"M7 20v2\"></path><path d=\"M7 2v2\"></path><rect x=\"4\" y=\"4\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" rx=\"1\"></rect></svg></span></div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold tracking-tight transition-colors duration-300 text-ssl-bg group-hover:text-ssl-blue\">Websites &amp; Web Apps</h3><p class=\"text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-slate-700\">We build fast, serverless websites and web apps (Next.js, Tailwind) that load quickly on African mobile networks, with Paystack, Flutterwave and CRM integrations.</p></div><span class=\"mt-auto inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-ssl-blue\">Learn more<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 transi