ct it to how leads actually enter your funnel, and score them so the right leads reach your sales team first.\"}]],\"ref\":null}],[\"$\",\"section\",\"The Outcome\",{\"className\":\"reveal reveal-slide-up glass-card-light glass-edge rounded-2xl p-7 md:p-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mb-5 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-ssl-blue to-[#0d3a8c] font-display text-sm font-bold text-white shadow-lg shadow-ssl-blue/25\",\"children\":[\"0\",3]}],[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-3 text-xl font-bold text-ssl-bg\",\"children\":\"The Outcome\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"leading-relaxed text-slate-700\",\"children\":\"One pipeline everyone trusts, less time chasing cold leads, and a clear line from marketing spend to closed revenue.\"}]],\"ref\":null}]]}]\n8:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto mt-24 max-w-3xl\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"reveal reveal-slide-up\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L19\",null,{\"align\":\"center\",\"overline\":\"FAQ\",\"title\":\"Common Questions\",\"variant\":\"light\",\"className\":\"mb-10\"}]}],[\"$\",\"$L1a\",null,{\"items\":[{\"question\":\"We already use a CRM. Why do we need RevOps?\",\"answer\":\"Having a CRM isn't the same as having it set up right. Many teams use only a fraction of what their CRM can do, and leads still fall through the cracks.\"},{\"question\":\"Which CRMs do you work with?\",\"answer\":\"HubSpot, Zoho, and Salesforce. If you're on something else, talk to us and we'll let you know if we can support it.\"},{\"question\":\"Can you work with our existing sales team, or do we need to change how they work?\",\"answer\":\"We build around your team's actual process. Some habits may need to change, but the goal is to make their job easier, not harder.\"}]}]]}]\n9:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto mt-24 max-w-6xl\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"reveal reveal-s